{"id": "3327530", "name": "אינטגרלים כפולים – החלפה ליניארית מותאמת לאינטגרנד", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 2, "questiontext": "<div title=\"BGU_STACK_Q8_CLEAR_LINEAR_V1\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width:100%;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2937;line-height:1.65;text-align:right;\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;\"><div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;color:#4B1F6F;\">החלפה ליניארית המותאמת לאינטגרנד</div></div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;\">\n          <div>יהי התחום <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle D\\)</span> המוגדר על ידי</div>\n\n          <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px;margin:8px 0;\">\n            \\(\\displaystyle\n            {{CT:0}}\\le {{CT:1}}\\le{{CT:2}},\\qquad\n            {{CT:3}}\\le {{CT:4}}\\le{{CT:5}}\n            \\)\n          </div>\n\n          <div>חשבו את האינטגרל</div>\n\n          <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:19px;margin:8px 0;\">\n            \\(\\displaystyle I=\\iint_D {{CT:6}}\\,dx\\,dy\\)\n          </div>\n\n          <div>השתמשו בהחלפה</div>\n\n          <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px;margin:8px 0;\">\n            \\(\\displaystyle\n            u={{CT:1}},\\qquad\n            v={{CT:4}}\n            \\)\n          </div>\n        </div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;\">\n          <div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4B1F6F;margin-bottom:10px;\">א. ההעתקה ההפוכה והיעקוביאן</div>\n\n          <div style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">\n            כתבו את <b>ההעתקה ההפוכה</b>, כלומר את\n            <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> ואת\n            <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\)</span> כפונקציות של\n            <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u,v\\)</span>,\n            וחשבו את היעקוביאן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(J\\)</span>.\n          </div>\n\n          <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(240px,390px));gap:12px;justify-content:center;align-items:start;\">\n       <div style=\"background:#F8F7F9;border:1px solid #E4DEE7;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 13px;\">\n       <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;white-space:nowrap;\">\n         <span>\\(\\displaystyle x(u,v)=\\)</span>[[input:ans1]]\n       </div>\n       <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:5px;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n     </div><div style=\"background:#F8F7F9;border:1px solid #E4DEE7;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 13px;\">\n       <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;white-space:nowrap;\">\n         <span>\\(\\displaystyle y(u,v)=\\)</span>[[input:ans2]]\n       </div>\n       <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:5px;\">[[validation:ans2]]</div>\n     </div>\n     </div>\n\n          <div style=\"max-width:300px;margin:12px auto 0;\">\n            <div style=\"background:#F8F7F9;border:1px solid #E4DEE7;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 13px;\">\n       <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;white-space:nowrap;\">\n         <span>\\(\\displaystyle J=\\)</span>[[input:ans3]]\n       </div>\n       <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:5px;\">[[validation:ans3]]</div>\n     </div>\n          </div>\n        </div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;\">\n          <div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4B1F6F;margin-bottom:10px;\">ב. התחום לאחר ההחלפה</div>\n\n          <div>\n            כתבו את התחום החדש בצורה\n          </div>\n\n          <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px;margin:8px 0 12px 0;\">\n            \\(\\displaystyle a\\le u\\le b,\\qquad c\\le v\\le d\\)\n          </div>\n\n          <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(210px,330px));gap:11px;justify-content:center;align-items:start;\">\n       <div style=\"background:#F8F7F9;border:1px solid #E4DEE7;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 13px;\">\n       <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;white-space:nowrap;\">\n         <span>\\(\\displaystyle a=\\)</span>[[input:ans4]]\n       </div>\n       <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:5px;\">[[validation:ans4]]</div>\n     </div><div style=\"background:#F8F7F9;border:1px solid #E4DEE7;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 13px;\">\n       <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;white-space:nowrap;\">\n         <span>\\(\\displaystyle b=\\)</span>[[input:ans5]]\n       </div>\n       <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:5px;\">[[validation:ans5]]</div>\n     </div><div style=\"background:#F8F7F9;border:1px solid #E4DEE7;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 13px;\">\n       <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;white-space:nowrap;\">\n         <span>\\(\\displaystyle c=\\)</span>[[input:ans6]]\n       </div>\n       <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:5px;\">[[validation:ans6]]</div>\n     </div><div style=\"background:#F8F7F9;border:1px solid #E4DEE7;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 13px;\">\n       <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;white-space:nowrap;\">\n         <span>\\(\\displaystyle d=\\)</span>[[input:ans7]]\n       </div>\n       <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:5px;\">[[validation:ans7]]</div>\n     </div>\n     </div>\n        </div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;\">\n          <div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4B1F6F;margin-bottom:10px;\">ג. חישוב האינטגרל</div>\n\n          <div style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\">\n            השתמשו בהחלפה וביעקוביאן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(J\\)</span> וחשבו את האינטגרל.\n          </div>\n\n          <div style=\"max-width:340px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"background:#F8F7F9;border:1px solid #E4DEE7;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 13px;\">\n       <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;white-space:nowrap;\">\n         <span>\\(\\displaystyle I=\\)</span>[[input:ans8]]\n       </div>\n       <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:5px;\">[[validation:ans8]]</div>\n     </div></div>\n        </div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div title=\"BGU_STACK_Q8_CLEAR_LINEAR_V1\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width:100%;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2937;line-height:1.65;text-align:right;\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;\"><div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;color:#4B1F6F;\">פתרון מלא</div></div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;\">\n          <p>פותרים את מערכת המשוואות ומקבלים</p>\n\n          <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:17px;\">\n            \\(\\displaystyle\n            x={{CT:7}},\\qquad\n            y={{CT:8}}\n            \\)\n          </div>\n\n          <p>היעקוביאן הוא</p>\n\n          <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:17px;\">\n            \\(\\displaystyle J={{CT:9}}\\)\n          </div>\n\n          <p>התחום החדש הוא המלבן</p>\n\n          <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:17px;\">\n            \\(\\displaystyle\n            {{CT:0}}\\le u\\le{{CT:2}},\\qquad\n            {{CT:3}}\\le v\\le{{CT:5}}\n            \\)\n          </div>\n\n          <p>לאחר ההחלפה, כולל היעקוביאן, האינטגרנד הוא</p>\n\n          <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:17px;\">\n            \\(\\displaystyle {{CT:10}}\\)\n          </div>\n\n          <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:17px;margin-top:10px;\">\n            \\(\\displaystyle\n            I=\n            \\int_{{{CT:0}}}^{{{CT:2}}}\n            \\int_{{{CT:3}}}^{{{CT:5}}}\n            {{CT:10}}\\,dv\\,du\n            ={{CT:11}}\n            \\)\n          </div>\n        </div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<div style=\"display: none;\">[[feedback:prt1]][[feedback:prt2]][[feedback:prt3]][[feedback:prt4]][[feedback:prt5]][[feedback:prt6]][[feedback:prt7]][[feedback:prt8]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">חלק מן התשובה נכון. בדקו את שאר הרכיבים.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה עדיין אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 12, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 8, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidatio